Error: Jet.TagUsedAsTrait: `Reviewed` is a tag, but `derive` needs a trait
  --> Tests/UI/tag_marker_derive.jet:10:2
    |
 10 | #Reviewed
    |  ^^^^^^^^
 Why: A value tag is a marker that erases at runtime and carries no methods; dispatch and method attachment need a `trait`
 Fix: Declare `Reviewed` as a `trait` with the method(s) it should provide
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.TagUsedAsTrait

